❯ clone this repository https://github.com/paltatech/VESC-controller

not a git repository; copperhead requires git for snapshots and rollback

why it failed: every run snapshots HEAD before editing so a failed run can be rolled back losslessly; without git there is no snapshot and no undo
to fix:
  1. git init
  2. git add -A && git commit -m "initial commit"
  3. rerun the same copperhead command
(session continues)

